        ✔ Update BuildBrushArchitecture.md and the README where behavior warrants it.
        ✔ Keep the source proposal's implementation status accurate; do not claim
          visual/performance qualification before Phase 6.
        ✔ Do not mark the existing project.todo indicator item complete yet.

Completion criteria:
    ✔ Required focused tests/builds pass and packaged assets load/compile.
      Evidence identifies the exact candidate and lists remaining user-run checks.

